# k.faces/shards/toon-head-mouth: the variants of the slot `mouth` in the DiceBear style `toon-head`: features, and parts converted from the drawings (a primitive shape, a box in the frame of the face, a draw order, a colour name and the exact colour; points for polygons and lines).
